    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n16967" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀτάρβ-ητος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			= foreg., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐνὶ στήθεσσιν ἀ. νόος ἐστίν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					3.63
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Hes.
				<u>Sc.</u>
				110
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				199
			</span></i>: neut. pl. as Adv., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὕβρις
				ἀτάρβητα ὁρμᾶται</span> stalks abroad <i>without fear,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Aj.</u>
				196
			</span></i>. Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-τως</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Suid.
				</span></i>
			
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>not dreaded,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κάματοι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>IG</u>
					14.1003.2
				</span></i>
			, cf. ib.<i><span class="en">
				7.96
			</span></i>.</div>
